{"id": 2287, "title": "Forgot to bring books", "japanese_title": "本を持っていくのを忘れた", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "forgot-to-bring-books", "audio_url": "/audio/japanese/2287_forgot-to-bring-books.mp3", "english_paragraphs": ["A: Hello? Where are you? You didn't bring your books!", "B: What? Who is this?", "A: It's your mom! I can see your books at home. You forgot them, didn't you?", "B: Mom! Yes, my books are at home. I don't need to bring them today.", "A: Okay, got it. What do you want to eat today?", "B: I want rice.", "A: Okay, rice it is. Bye.", "B: Bye!"], "english_full": "A: Hello? Where are you? You didn't bring your books!\n\nB: What? Who is this?\n\nA: It's your mom! I can see your books at home. You forgot them, didn't you?\n\nB: Mom! Yes, my books are at home. I don't need to bring them today.\n\nA: Okay, got it. What do you want to eat today?\n\nB: I want rice.\n\nA: Okay, rice it is. Bye.\n\nB: Bye!", "japanese_paragraphs": ["A：もしもし、今どこにいるの？ 本、持っていってないじゃない！", "B：え？ 誰？", "A：お母さんよ！ あなたの本が家にあるの。忘れたんでしょ？", "B：あ、お母さん！ うん、本は家にあるよ。今日は持っていかなくていいんだ。", "A：そう、わかった。今日は何が食べたい？", "B：ご飯が食べたい。", "A：わかった。じゃあ、ご飯ね。バイバイ。", "B：バイバイ！"], "reading_paragraphs": ["えー：もしもし、いま どこ に いるの？ ほん、もっていってない じゃない！", "びー：え？ だれ？", "えー：おかあさん よ！ あなた の ほん が いえ に あるの。わすれたん でしょ？", "びー：あ、おかあさん！ うん、ほん は いえ に あるよ。きょう は もっていかなくて いいんだ。", "えー：そう、わかった。きょう は なに が たべたい？", "びー：ごはん が たべたい。", "えー：わかった。じゃあ、ごはん ね。ばいばい。", "びー：ばいばい！"], "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ゆう\" data-defn=\"Excellent (grade)/A; superiority/excellence\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"：\" data-defn=\"： (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">：</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"もしもし\" data-defn=\"hello (e.g. on phone); excuse me! (when calling out to someone)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">もしもし</span><rt></rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"いま\" data-defn=\"now / at present\" data-hsk=\"JL